    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Esteemed faculty, paediatrician and Interim Chair of AKU's Division of Women and Child Health: Professor Iqtidar Khan, was recently recognised for his contributions to the University over nearly three decades, surrounded by colleagues, family and friends. The Medical College communications team sat down with him as he recounted his AKU journey and shared what he has planned for the next chapter of his life.",
